WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.240
I’m ranking EVERY SWORD USER IN ANIME from&nbsp;
sword fighters who get HARD CARRIED by their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:08.920
own magic to some of the most skillful&nbsp;
samurai we have ever seen all the way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:16.040
to the absolute peak of sword masters, who&nbsp;
are so powerful they might as well be gods.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:20.240
And to really kick this list off, let’s&nbsp;
reveal our first god-tier swordswoman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:28.080
who is Saber from the Fate Series. And wow,&nbsp;
Saber is the literal definition of God tier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:33.440
because her unmatched sword skills allow her to&nbsp;
defeat even the strongest sword fighters with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:39.240
ease. But if we’re being honest, her true&nbsp;
powers come from combining her terrifying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:46.040
swordplay and her legendary magic to wipe&nbsp;
out opponents with NUCLEAR scale attacks.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.480
And what a way to start the rankings! But Saber is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.080
far from the only God Tier sword user&nbsp;
because there are a total of ten of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:59.000
these monstrous powerhouses who could wipe&nbsp;
out every other sword user on this list.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:03.360
That’s not to say that this next group of&nbsp;
characters wouldn’t put up a fight though&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:09.120
because our next Tier is the Superhuman&nbsp;
Sword Users, who you might argue could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:15.520
even hold their own in a fight against the&nbsp;
God Tiers. And the perfect example of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:21.720
tier is Clare from Claymore who combines her&nbsp;
INSANELY fast windcutter sword technique with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:29.040
her astonishingly powerful yoki transformations&nbsp;
to slice even the strongest enemies to pieces.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:34.320
However, while those top two tiers are&nbsp;
just stupidly powerful, this next tier is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:41.160
my personal favorite. That’s because the Pure&nbsp;
Samurai tier is full of the most incredible&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:47.680
natural sword users in all of anime. No&nbsp;
magic. No superhuman powers. Just raw,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:54.440
beautiful swordsmanship. And there’s no better&nbsp;
example of this than Afro from Afro Samurai&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.440 --> 00:02:00.000
who uses his lethal techniques to cut down his&nbsp;
enemies while he hunts down his father’s killer.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.520
This next tier is going to be the MOST&nbsp;
CONTROVERSIAL though because now we have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:10.000
the I’m Only A Strong Swordsman Because I’m&nbsp;
a Main Character tier. And let’s be honest,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.720
it’s super easy to give a character a sword&nbsp;
and just call them a master swordsman. Almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:21.280
every anime does it because you don’t have to&nbsp;
have a complicated power system or in-depth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:27.640
explanation to say someone is a sword master.&nbsp;
And the perfect example of this is the Goblin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:32.640
Slayer from the anime with the same name&nbsp;
because this author just straight up said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:38.760
Goblin Slayer is a master of basically&nbsp;
every single weapon. So yeah, not really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:45.000
convincing me that he is a true sword master,&nbsp;
so he goes right in the Main Character tier.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.320
But even the main character swordsmen&nbsp;
are more impressive than our next tier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:55.480
which is what I like to call the Toothpick&nbsp;
Tier. And I’m just going to pop Rin Okumura&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:01.920
right here because while he does technically&nbsp;
use a sword and we’ve seen him use it in combat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:06.640
the vast majority of his power comes&nbsp;
from his magical blue flames which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:11.960
leaves his actual sword skills&nbsp;
far behind others on this list.

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:15.200
Now, by this point if you might have&nbsp;
noticed this tier list is not ranked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:20.200
by JUST HOW STRONG a character is or&nbsp;
JUST their pure sword skill. Instead,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.200
I had to consider all of a character’s&nbsp;
unique skills and abilities in terms of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:29.520
how it affects their sword fighting. Which is&nbsp;
why if you are just popping off magic spells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:35.240
and barely use your sword like Overlord here,&nbsp;
you are going straight into Toothpick Tier.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:39.520
On the other hand, if your magic directly&nbsp;
enhances your sword-wielding abilities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.520
like Fullmetal Alchemist’s King Bradley, you&nbsp;
rise up the list. And let me just tell you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:51.160
I’ve always loved Bradley’s powers. I mean he&nbsp;
can use five blades and his ultimate eye even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:55.840
lets him see a bit into the future as well&nbsp;
as his opponent's strengths and weaknesses,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.840 --> 00:04:00.720
which is just perfect for the Superhuman&nbsp;
Tier. And I will add here that I’m not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:04.640
exactly sorting each tier from top to&nbsp;
bottom by power in case you were wondering.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:10.920
But even Bradley would likely get DESTROYED&nbsp;
by Yuta Okkotsu from JuJutsu Kaisen,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:17.760
who is our first character to land in a&nbsp;
special tier outside of the main five. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:24.880
is the Swords Are My Side Hustle Tier, which is&nbsp;
perfect for characters like Yuta who ARE highly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:30.320
skilled with their blades, but mainly rely on&nbsp;
their other magical techniques when fighting.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:35.040
For this next ranking though, I just have to&nbsp;
tell you about one of these most criminally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:42.440
underrated and unknown sword fighting anime, Sword&nbsp;
of the Stranger. And WOW the final battle between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:49.360
Nanashi and Lou Lang is just a pure injection of&nbsp;
samurai brilliance, which lands them both in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:55.520
Pure Samurai Tier. Seriously, go check it out if&nbsp;
you haven’t already experienced this masterclass.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.120
As much as it pains me to say it, both&nbsp;
of those characters would certainly be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:04.120
cut apart by Nobunaga from Hunter x Hunter.&nbsp;
Because while you could say Nobunaga’s sword&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:09.760
techniques aren’t any better than Nanashi or Lou&nbsp;
Lang, our favorite Phantom Troupe Samurai has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:16.160
the added benefit of Nen Enhancement to take&nbsp;
his physical abilities to superhuman levels.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:21.160
Now, let’s go back right up to the top of&nbsp;
the ranking, because it is time to reveal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:27.520
our second God Tier sword fighter. Because&nbsp;
here we have the captain of the 11th Division,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:33.240
Kenpachi from Bleach. And now, come&nbsp;
on, how could I not rank him up in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:38.560
God Tier? He has superhuman strength and&nbsp;
endurance, unmatched pure sword skills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:43.560
and he even restricts his own strength so&nbsp;
that he can enjoy battles longer. But man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:50.400
when he unleashes his full potential,&nbsp;
it is a scary sight for his opponents.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:55.640
And this isn’t the only character we’ll see&nbsp;
from this legendary sword fighting anime,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.640 --> 00:05:58.960
but do you think any others will make God Tier?

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:04.600
But this next character is so insanely&nbsp;
powerful that he nearly broke this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:10.280
ranking. That’s because D, from Vampire&nbsp;
Hunter D, is basically an immortal being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:17.000
who is a master of literally every weapon you&nbsp;
can think of. And on top of that, he even has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:22.720
reality bending abilities. So even though D&nbsp;
uses a sword and is technically a swordsman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:28.080
I didn’t know where to put him, so I made a&nbsp;
Too Stupidly Powerful tier and put him there.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:34.600
And you could almost say the same for Alibaba&nbsp;
from Magi, but his powers are more reasonable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:39.520
as he is an extremely skilled swordsman with&nbsp;
quick reflexes and hyper awareness of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:44.840
surroundings. But what earns him a spot&nbsp;
in the Superhuman tier is his fire Djinn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.920
which allows him to combine his impressive&nbsp;
swordsmanship with scorching magical flames.

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:55.520
But he’s still not as strong as another&nbsp;
character from Magi because Sinbad has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:55.520 --> 00:07:00.520
all the same skills as Alibaba only&nbsp;
he has SEVEN elemental Djinn instead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.240
of one. So bam, let’s pop Sinbad just right there.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:10.800
Enough with the magic though, let’s talk about one&nbsp;
of the MOST FAMOUS swordsmen in all of anime. Of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:16.600
course, I’m talking about Himura Kenshin from&nbsp;
the Rurouni Kenshin anime. This man is just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:23.600
the perfect definition of a pure samurai. He even&nbsp;
fights with the dull edge of his blade because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:29.640
his commitment to never kill again, plus he has&nbsp;
incredible determination to protect his friends.

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:33.280
You might be wondering though if&nbsp;
we ranked Kenshin in Pure Samurai,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:38.240
well what about his master, Hiko Seijuro?&nbsp;
Well, considering Seijuro’s supreme&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:43.360
strength and mastery of every legendary Hiten&nbsp;
Mitsururgi technique, I don’t think anyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:48.960
would debate that he far surpasses his student&nbsp;
and ascends straight into the Superhuman tier.

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:54.600
Whew, this is getting intense, and I can already&nbsp;
feel the hot flames from the comments below,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.600 --> 00:07:58.920
but this next ranking might make even more&nbsp;
of you furious because I’m ranking Zabuza&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:03.840
from Naruto in the Toothpick Tier.&nbsp;
That’s right, I said it. Toothpick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:09.440
for Zabuza. And while he’s undoubtedly many&nbsp;
people’s favorite villain from early Naruto,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:16.320
his actual sword skills just don’t stack up&nbsp;
with the rest of the characters on this list.

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:20.640
This next one though might be even more&nbsp;
controversial. Because it’s time to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:26.560
introduce another of our special tiers, the&nbsp;
Too Cool for Swords Tier. And we’re kicking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:32.240
this off with Denji from Chainsawman. And yes, I&nbsp;
know, I know, he’s not technically a swordsman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:39.320
but he uses blades, and he’s super cool, so I&nbsp;
just had to find a spot for him on the list.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:46.160
But right next to Denji’s tier is the most&nbsp;
fun tier in this ranking with the Help,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:52.000
My Sword Is Alive tier. And there’s no more&nbsp;
perfect character to start this with than Yato,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:56.880
from one of my personal favorite anime,&nbsp;
Noragami. And if you didn’t know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:01.360
Yato’s blades are literally the living&nbsp;
souls of dead humans that he has bonded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:05.760
and become friends with. So,&nbsp;
a perfect fit for this tier.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:09.480
What’s even more debatable though&nbsp;
is Asuna’s ranking in this tier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:14.440
list. Because the Swordswoman from Sword&nbsp;
Art Online conveniently always seems to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:19.280
forget how to fight whenever the plot needs&nbsp;
her to be a damsel in distress. So honestly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:23.600
there’s no perfect place for her&nbsp;
than the Main Character tier.

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:27.000
Now, it’s time for your favorite&nbsp;
sword anime’s favorite swordsman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:32.000
Geomon from Lupin the 3rd. This chad&nbsp;
from OG anime fights with his reality&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:37.280
bending Zantesuken sword, which can cut&nbsp;
anything including buildings, helicopters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:43.960
and hilariously even the 4th wall when he cut&nbsp;
the film sheets of his own anime. Geomon, my man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:50.480
breaking barriers everywhere. Which is enough&nbsp;
for him to just push into Superhuman tier.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:57.200
We can’t talk about breaking barriers though&nbsp;
without bringing up our next God Tier character.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:03.960
And in a bit of a twist, this is going to&nbsp;
be a God Tier Pair, because Toji Fushiguro&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:10.560
and Maki Zenin basically have the same powers&nbsp;
and are both unrivaled when it comes to sheer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:17.040
physical abilities. Seriously, no one touches&nbsp;
their pure strength and durability. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:22.120
their sword abilities are also next&nbsp;
level, which puts them firmly in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:27.400
conversation as some of the strongest&nbsp;
characters in all of JuJutsu Kaisen.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:34.360
And now I’m going to hit you with a double bit of&nbsp;
Pure Samurai brilliance. Because next up we have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:40.320
Jin from Samurai Champloo who is a brilliant&nbsp;
technician of the purest swordplay. His moves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:46.880
are precise. His footwork is flawless. He is&nbsp;
a model samurai in every sense of the world.

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:53.240
And even though Jin is arguably slightly stronger,&nbsp;
I’m also going to place Mugen right next to his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:59.040
friend from Champloo. But wow, you’ll never meet&nbsp;
two swordsmen so completely different because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.040 --> 00:11:04.800
Mugen has developed his own sword style based on&nbsp;
a mind-blowing combination of breakdancing and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:11.280
stolen techniques from his opponents. Honestly,&nbsp;
though, I always love watching this man fight.

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:16.880
From these incredible swordsmen though, we&nbsp;
drop right into the Toothpick tier with Ryuko&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:22.200
Matoi from Kill La Kill. And as much as I love&nbsp;
seeing Ryuko swing around one half of a giant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:27.920
pair of scissors to cut down armies of magic&nbsp;
clothes wearing enemies, I’d say like 95% of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:33.800
her power comes from her own magic clothes and&nbsp;
not from her actual sword skills themselves.

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:38.200
At least she’s better than Bell Cranel from&nbsp;
Is it Wrong to Pick up Girls in a Dungeon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:41.160
though, because his lack of&nbsp;
confidence and over reliance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:45.760
on magic put him basically at&nbsp;
the bottom of Toothpick Tier.

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:50.400
This next ranking is going to hurt some&nbsp;
of your hearts though because I simply&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:56.240
had to rank Kakashi from Naruto in the&nbsp;
Swords are my Side Hustle tier. And I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:59.920
know some of you would love to see him&nbsp;
up in a different tier, but seriously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:06.800
this dude has way too many powers and we&nbsp;
rarely see him fighting with an actual sword.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:13.800
Which might make you extra mad when I rank&nbsp;
Sasuke all the way up in the Superhuman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:18.920
Tier. Because yeah, I get Sasuke has all of the&nbsp;
chakra techniques, Six Paths Powers, Susanoo,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:25.080
and the Rinnegan, but the show puts a much greater&nbsp;
emphasis on Sasuke’s swordsmanship and even gives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:30.920
him a named blade. So yeah, sorry Kakashi fans,&nbsp;
Sasuke is without a doubt the better swordsman.

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:38.280
And joining Sasuke in the Superhuman tier is&nbsp;
a LEGENDARY duo from Final Fantasy. Of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:43.640
I’m talking about Cloud and Sephiroth,&nbsp;
who both just have these awesome giant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:48.760
blades. Now hold on, I know you’re saying&nbsp;
Final Fantasy is a video game, but come on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:53.120
how can I make a sword ranking video&nbsp;
and not include them? Plus there is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:57.560
technically a Final Fantasy anime so yeah,&nbsp;
I don’t want to hear any complaints here!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:01.880
Which brings us to the man with the&nbsp;
MOST FAMOUS swordsman in all of anime.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:01.880 --> 00:13:07.680
The ABSOLUTE GOD TIER Black Swordsman&nbsp;
himself! Kirito from SAO! Wait… wait,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:11.240
hold on, that’s not right. Kirito goes down here.

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:18.520
It’s time for the REAL Black Swordsman, who&nbsp;
is of course Guts from Berserk. And come on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:23.680
what more do I really need to say? Guts’&nbsp;
unbreakable will leads him to cut down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:29.760
armies of demons and even fight a literal&nbsp;
god to satisfy his thirst for vengeance.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:36.080
But from a God Slayer, this next swordsman&nbsp;
is basically a God themselves. That’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:40.880
because Reinhard from Re:Zero combines his&nbsp;
INSANE natural sword talent with his over&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:46.280
one hundred magical diving protections. And&nbsp;
this makes him so absurdly powerful that even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.280 --> 00:13:51.520
the author of the story essentiallysaid&nbsp;
there is no way to actually kill him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:56.520
Which means I nearly put him in the Stupidly&nbsp;
Overpowered Tier, but since he is seriously&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:56.520 --> 00:14:01.280
talented with the sword, I just couldn’t&nbsp;
bring myself to drop him out of God Tier.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:06.400
The same can’t be said for Gilgamesh from Fate&nbsp;
though because he is a similar God-like character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:12.960
and he uses so many original Noble Phantasms&nbsp;
that he is basically unbeatable. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:20.160
only ONE of these Noble Phantasms is a sword.&nbsp;
That is of course Ea, also called the Divergent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:26.080
Sword, which is a magical blade capable of&nbsp;
creating world-shattering attacks. So yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:31.960
he barely counts as a sword user, but I have&nbsp;
to put him in the stupidly overpowered tier.

00:14:31.960 --> 00:14:35.360
Which is actually similar&nbsp;
to Yu Kanda from D.Gray Man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:40.800
who mostly uses his sword as a vessel&nbsp;
for his many magical attacks. He’s not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:45.160
as ridiculously strong though, so&nbsp;
he can go in the Side Hustle Tier

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:52.560
No one will argue that Gintoki from Gintama&nbsp;
isn’t jaw droppingly powerful because with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:57.120
STAGGERING strength and endurance combined&nbsp;
with his straight up brutal sword skills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:02.880
Gintoki is certainly deserving of the&nbsp;
top spot in Pure Samurai, for now.

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:07.160
And you might even argue that he&nbsp;
should have been in Superhuman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:14.160
but one character who without a doubt deserves&nbsp;
this tier is Ryuma from One Piece. And this man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:14.160 --> 00:15:20.040
is literally a legend who is even famously&nbsp;
called the Sword God. But despite that I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:26.120
just couldn’t put him in God Tier because we just&nbsp;
haven’t seen him truly fight in the actual anime.

00:15:27.600 --> 00:15:32.120
And if you think that’s insane, well then&nbsp;
just wait until you hear that I'm also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:37.920
placing Zoro into the Superhuman category&nbsp;
alongside his distant relative. And yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:43.120
I’m trying to be fair. No One Piece bias&nbsp;
to put Zoro in God tier, but for now the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:48.680
three-style swordsman just isn’t strong enough&nbsp;
to even earn the top spot in his own story,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:52.200
so I just can’t put him into&nbsp;
our top ten in this ranking.

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:57.840
But even being a hero doesn’t&nbsp;
save Kamina from Gurren Lagann,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.960
from being placed in the Main&nbsp;
Character tier, because yes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:06.800
while his extra long sword is cool, I’ve just&nbsp;
never been super impressed with his techniques.

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:12.280
To sink even further though, next&nbsp;
we have Vicious from Cowboy Bebop,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:17.800
who honestly barely made this ranking since&nbsp;
he only rarely fights in the story. However,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:23.320
I have to give him credit for bringing a sword&nbsp;
to a show dominated by guns, so props to him.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:28.240
I can’t say the same for Inuyasha though&nbsp;
because even though he possesses basically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:34.720
the strongest sword in his entire anime, he&nbsp;
still mostly fights with his demonic powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:39.720
claws, and raw strength to win his&nbsp;
battles. Shoutout to the OG anime though.

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:47.040
Speaking of the OG’s though, Manji from Blade of&nbsp;
the Immortal has been around since the early 90’s,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:53.920
and man, he is one of the coolest swordsmen on&nbsp;
this list. He is basically immortal, but even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:59.760
before he became immortal he has won countless&nbsp;
deathmatches. Plus, he has a breathtaking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:06.080
collection of blades which means he simply&nbsp;
must go near the top of the Pure Samurai Tier.

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:10.560
There’s still one character that will&nbsp;
top even him in this tier though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:17.560
but for now let’s reveal our sixth God-Tier sword&nbsp;
fighter with Yami Sukehiro from Black Clover. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:25.200
without a doubt he is an incredible swordsman,&nbsp;
and he is the PERFECT example of combining supreme&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:32.800
skill with mind-blowing magic to create attacks&nbsp;
that can completely obliterate the environment.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:40.560
But if you want a true Samurai sensei, look&nbsp;
no further than Haruko from That Time I Got&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:44.680
Reincarnated as a Slime. Because even&nbsp;
though this man was originally an ogre,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:51.680
he perfected his swordplay which is&nbsp;
enhanced by his extra magical senses.

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:54.680
And right next to him is the character&nbsp;
who is said to be on his same level,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:59.760
Hinata Sakaguchi. And you wouldn’t know it&nbsp;
by looking at her, but she has essentially&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:06.360
2000 years worth of battle experience&nbsp;
which makes her a true sword master.

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:10.320
But I feel like the characters in the&nbsp;
special tiers are getting a bit lonely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:16.080
so let’s jump back into the My Sword is&nbsp;
Alive Tier with Big Mom from One Piece. Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:21.200
admittedly she mostly relies on her&nbsp;
brutal strength rather than sword skills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:26.640
but what’s cool about her is that her sword&nbsp;
Napoleon has actually been infused with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:32.120
piece of her own soul so that it can freely&nbsp;
change its size and even turn into a hat.

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:37.320
And sticking in the same tier, we&nbsp;
have the definition of a living sword&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:42.920
with Funkfreed. Now if you don’t know,&nbsp;
this sword literally ate a devil fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:46.800
allowing it to transform from&nbsp;
a regular blade into a full&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:51.880
on living elephant. *chuckle/shake&nbsp;
head* Yup. That’s One Piece for you.

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:58.920
Now, these next two fighters were impossibly&nbsp;
tough to rank. That’s because Levi and Mikasa&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:05.240
Ackerman are without a doubt the strongest&nbsp;
non-titan fighters in all of Attack on Titan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:08.880
And since they primarily use blades,&nbsp;
and are very similar in abilities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:15.240
I just had to include them. But where is the&nbsp;
question?? Certainty, these two have superhuman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:20.880
abilities and can slice through titans with&nbsp;
ease, but I also think they get wrecked by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:27.800
most of the swordsman in the upper tiers.&nbsp;
So to be fair, let’s put them in Superhuman.

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:33.840
But now we have one of the characters with&nbsp;
the most unique weapons, which is Yor from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:40.200
Spy Family. And this deadly assassin uses these&nbsp;
lethal stiletto blades to do her bloody work,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.960
which makes her perfect for&nbsp;
the Too Cool for Swords Tier.

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:50.960
Even Yor can’t compare to the sheer&nbsp;
ridiculousness of Shichika Yasuri from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:56.240
Katanagatari though because hold on, just listen&nbsp;
to this. Shichika learned sword techniques growing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:02.600
up, but instead of using ANY KIND OF BLADE&nbsp;
he uses his bare hands and feet to slash his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:09.360
opponents. Like, what??? I guess he is just&nbsp;
absolutely perfect for this category though.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:14.640
But now for a character from a manhwa, we have&nbsp;
Jinwoo from Solo Leveling. And if you’ve read&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:19.720
the manhwa already then you’ll know that&nbsp;
Jinwoo is a master of his dual daggers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:24.320
but his true power comes from his&nbsp;
astonishing strength, magic, speed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:31.880
durability, and healing powers. So just pop&nbsp;
him into the Swords are My Side Hustle Tier.

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:36.840
Which is also where we’re going to put&nbsp;
the only My Hero Academia character on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:42.160
this list. Because Stain here mostly uses&nbsp;
his blades to cut opponents so that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:48.120
can taste their blood and activate his special&nbsp;
quirk. So not quite the traditional swordsman.

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:54.720
And while Stain basically idolizes the main&nbsp;
character of MHA, Akame from Akame Ga Kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:54.720 --> 00:21:00.840
is a strong swordswoman with her famous poison&nbsp;
coated blade. And while she is undoubtedly strong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:04.880
I don’t think she stacks up to&nbsp;
other characters on this list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:08.000
so she’s going into the Main Character tier.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:13.760
This next one’s going to get me in a lot of&nbsp;
trouble though, because for these next two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:18.320
characters, I’m going to tell you who&nbsp;
they are before we rank them. First,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:25.720
we have Ichigo from Bleach, and then Asta from&nbsp;
Black Clover. One of them is in God Tier and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:32.280
other is Superhuman. So which one is which??? Oh&nbsp;
man, this is going to piss so many people off, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:38.480
I just couldn’t live with myself if I didn’t put&nbsp;
Ichigo into God Tier because come on, he’s Ichigo.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:44.880
Which unfortunately means that Asta is&nbsp;
going into Superhuman. And to be fair,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:49.000
he can summon anti-magic swords&nbsp;
which can cut through any magic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:54.600
but if he isn’t fighting a magic user they are&nbsp;
basically just blunt weapons. Though he has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:54.600 --> 00:22:00.320
proven to be highly effective at using them to&nbsp;
defeat his opponents with his ridiculous speed.

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:04.480
To show I’m not totally biased towards&nbsp;
Bleach though, I’ll throw Urahara into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:09.040
Superhuman as well, even though his bankai&nbsp;
lets him instantly split anything in its&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:15.440
area of effect. So I don’t know??? Maybe&nbsp;
that is God Tier? But no, I’ll leave him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:15.440 --> 00:22:21.840
here. But that means we only have three God&nbsp;
Tiers left which I can’t wait to show you…

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:27.640
Before that though, we have another beloved&nbsp;
character with Thorfinn from Vinland Saga.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:27.640 --> 00:22:32.800
And even though he isn’t a Samurai per&nbsp;
say, I think his sword skills deserve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:37.840
more than a spot in the Main Character&nbsp;
tier so we’ll put him in Pure Samurai.

00:22:37.840 --> 00:22:41.760
I can’t say the same for Shana from&nbsp;
Shakugna no Shana though because even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:45.360
though she is a skilled swordswoman,&nbsp;
her lack of battle experience means she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:50.520
often relies on her flame spells,&nbsp;
so she’s going into the MC Tier…

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:55.240
Right next to Stella Vermillion from&nbsp;
Chivalry of a Failed Knight. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:59.520
come on, even with her impressive&nbsp;
magic, royal heritage, and years of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:04.920
training she lost to our next character&nbsp;
in their very first duel of the series.

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:10.040
And of course I’m talking about Ikki&nbsp;
Kurogane. And this man definitely deserves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:15.760
Pure Samurai tier because Ikki taught himself&nbsp;
swordsmanship over the years by watching masters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:15.760 --> 00:23:22.480
and challenging dojos to eventually become&nbsp;
one of the strongest fighters in the world.

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:27.080
Even Ikki isn’t strong enough for the&nbsp;
top of this legendary tier though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:27.080 --> 00:23:34.320
and for me personally that belongs to Miyamoto&nbsp;
from the Vagabond manga. Seriously, this man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:34.320 --> 00:23:41.120
is a wild beast of a fighter with his ridiculous&nbsp;
physical strength, Guts-level unbreakable will,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:47.480
and he even developed his own two sword style&nbsp;
to maximize offense and defense. Plus the art,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:52.600
man. Wow. I’ll never get over&nbsp;
some of the panels in this manga.

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:59.000
That’s still not enough to beat&nbsp;
this next God Tier character though,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:05.120
because Dracule Mihawk from One Piece&nbsp;
is literally known as the Strongest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:09.760
swordsman in the world. And with his&nbsp;
world famous blade and his ability to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:09.760 --> 00:24:16.000
casually slash through mountains, he certainly&nbsp;
deserves his status as a god tier swordsman.

00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:21.560
But is that enough to decide the age old debate&nbsp;
about Shanks versus Mihawk? I mean in the story&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:21.560 --> 00:24:27.600
we know they used to duel and we’ve seen just&nbsp;
how absolutely soul-crushingly powerful Shanks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:27.600 --> 00:24:33.360
is as a swordsman, but I still don’t know… So I’ll&nbsp;
just leave them next to each other for now. Let me&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:33.360 --> 00:24:39.320
know what you think in the comments and if you’d&nbsp;
like to see a whole future video on the topic.

00:24:39.320 --> 00:24:44.040
Which just leaves one God Tier character&nbsp;
left, but before we get there we have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:44.840 --> 00:24:50.720
Gabimaru from Hell’s Paradise who is&nbsp;
a top tier ninja. And honestly he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:50.720 --> 00:24:55.240
exceptionally talented with a sword and&nbsp;
kunai, but without a doubt he prefers hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:55.240 --> 00:25:01.200
to hand combat and using his ridiculous&nbsp;
fire powers. So Side Hustle for Gabimaru.

00:25:01.200 --> 00:25:05.720
Which leaves Melidoas from Seven Deadly&nbsp;
Sins as our last Side Hustler because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:05.720 --> 00:25:09.400
let's be honest… Of course he has his&nbsp;
sacred treasure sword Lostvayne which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:13.840
allows him to clone himself. And&nbsp;
Meliodas IS unimaginably strong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:13.840 --> 00:25:19.480
but I just think it’s less about his sword&nbsp;
skills and more about his demonic powers.

00:25:19.480 --> 00:25:25.040
Which brings us to Meliodas’ friend&nbsp;
Escanor, who is Too Cool for Swords&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:25.040 --> 00:25:31.360
because he uses this GIANT. ONE-HANDED. AX.&nbsp;
And while he probably shouldn’t be on here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:31.360 --> 00:25:34.200
he is also too cool to leave off the ranking.

00:25:34.200 --> 00:25:39.920
But how could I ever make an anime tier list&nbsp;
without including the chadest anime of all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:39.920 --> 00:25:46.040
JoJo’s? Which means that it’s time to put&nbsp;
Polnareff into the My Sword is Alive tier&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:46.040 --> 00:25:51.280
because his Stand, Silver Chariot, uses a&nbsp;
rapier with devastating power and skill.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:51.280 --> 00:25:56.120
But don’t think this is just magic though&nbsp;
because Polnareff has trained with Silver&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:56.120 --> 00:26:01.320
Chariot to an absurd degree to make them&nbsp;
both an incredible sword fighting team.

00:26:01.320 --> 00:26:07.720
Now we’ve gone this long without bringing up one&nbsp;
of the most popular recent sword fighting anime,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:07.720 --> 00:26:12.400
which is of course Demon Slayer.&nbsp;
So we just have to include Tanjiro,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:12.400 --> 00:26:17.760
and honestly I considered putting him in&nbsp;
the Main Character tier, but he truly works&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:17.760 --> 00:26:24.080
super hard and has come quite a long way, so at&nbsp;
this point he deserves the Pure Samurai tier.

00:26:24.080 --> 00:26:29.160
Hyakkimaru from Dororo isn’t so lucky though.&nbsp;
Because even though he is one of the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:29.160 --> 00:26:34.480
interesting characters on this list. Just listen&nbsp;
to this, since his body parts were stolen by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:34.480 --> 00:26:39.680
demons, his current body is mostly made up of&nbsp;
artificial parts that can shoot out chemicals,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:39.680 --> 00:26:43.840
poison and explosives. However, with&nbsp;
just considering his sword skills,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:43.840 --> 00:26:48.680
nothing he did really impressed me enough&nbsp;
to move him out of the Main Character tier.

00:26:48.680 --> 00:26:54.360
But even Hyakkimari gets more credit than Aki&nbsp;
from Chainsawman, who initially used a sword,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:54.360 --> 00:26:59.680
but mostly relies on his devil contracts&nbsp;
which lands him in the Toothpick tier.

00:26:59.680 --> 00:27:04.000
Which is a similar fate for Arthur&nbsp;
Boyle from Fire Force. And honestly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:04.000 --> 00:27:09.680
Arthur was one of the hardest characters to judge.&nbsp;
Because he fights with a sword made of flames,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:09.680 --> 00:27:14.320
but he suffers from low confidence for&nbsp;
most of the story. Plus there are almost&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:14.320 --> 00:27:20.000
no other sword uses in the story, so because&nbsp;
of all this, it's Toothpick Tier for Arthur.

00:27:20.600 --> 00:27:25.800
One man who has no lack of confidence though&nbsp;
is Shion from Hell’s Paradise. Because even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:25.800 --> 00:27:32.440
though he is LITERALLY BLIND, he has DEADLY&nbsp;
fast sword skills that can cut down even the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:32.440 --> 00:27:37.080
strongest enemies with ease. And even though he&nbsp;
eventually gets physical boosts from Wood Tao,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:37.080 --> 00:27:41.400
Shion is still the definition&nbsp;
of a Pure Samurai for me.

00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:47.680
Which brings us to some of the most fun characters&nbsp;
to rank, starting with Demon Eye Kyo. And wow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:47.680 --> 00:27:52.960
this man has insane demonic AND spiritual&nbsp;
powers, which give him tremendous healing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:52.960 --> 00:27:57.960
boosts in physical strength, elemental attacks&nbsp;
based on the Chinese Shijin, and even an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:57.960 --> 00:28:03.960
intimidating aura to destroy an opponent's&nbsp;
will to fight. Oh, and he’s a ridiculously&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:03.960 --> 00:28:09.840
skilled swordsman. Seriously, what an insane&nbsp;
character who fully deserves Superhuman Tier.

00:28:09.840 --> 00:28:15.280
It’s debatable though if he’s stronger than&nbsp;
Atomic Samurai from One Punch Man, who can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:15.280 --> 00:28:22.920
slash 100 times in a single second. Which if&nbsp;
that’s not superhuman then I don't know what is.

00:28:25.560 --> 00:28:32.160
This next one is going to make some people furious&nbsp;
though because now we have Guts’ main rival,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:32.160 --> 00:28:37.240
Griffith from Berserk. And even though they&nbsp;
were basically even in the Golden Age arc,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:37.240 --> 00:28:41.840
I just can’t put them on the same level,&nbsp;
so Griffith goes to Superhuman as well.

00:28:41.840 --> 00:28:46.840
Which is the exact same tier as Ezra from&nbsp;
Fairy Tail, and while she’s definitely not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:46.840 --> 00:28:51.720
the strongest character in this tier, she has&nbsp;
some of the highest versatility in the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:51.720 --> 00:28:55.440
ranking. That’s because her expertise&nbsp;
with her Requip magic allows her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:55.440 --> 00:29:00.240
swap between over TWO HUNDRED different&nbsp;
blades, which is certainly impressive.

00:29:02.520 --> 00:29:09.400
Which brings us to Yoriichi from Demon Slayer,&nbsp;
who was SO POWERFUL that he could even terrify&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:09.400 --> 00:29:14.240
a literal god-like demon. Seriously,&nbsp;
he is basically the true godfather of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:14.240 --> 00:29:20.480
demon slayers and even without crazy magic&nbsp;
abilities in my opinion he is the greatest&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:20.480 --> 00:29:27.360
pure swordsman in the entire ranking,&nbsp;
which earns him a spot in God Tier.

00:29:27.360 --> 00:29:32.160
I’ll be completely honest though, there was one&nbsp;
more character who was so sooo close to making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:32.160 --> 00:29:37.720
God Tier. This is Hiei from Yu Yu Hakasho,&nbsp;
who is undoubtedly a God Tier fighter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:37.720 --> 00:29:43.040
but since he uses so many magic-based attacks&nbsp;
alongside his swordsmanship, I just couldn’t put&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:43.040 --> 00:29:49.640
him into the God Tier of this ranking. And one of&nbsp;
those magic abilities is a fiery blast so powerful&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:49.640 --> 00:29:56.520
it can literally turn people into dust. And if&nbsp;
you want to see just how high these fire powers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:56.520 --> 00:30:02.880
pushed Hiei on my Ranking of Every Fire User in&nbsp;
Anime, you can check out that video right here.

00:30:02.880 --> 00:30:06.520
Thanks for watching, and&nbsp;
I’ll see you in the next one.

